## Proposed Changes

### Backend Solutions & Core Architecture

We will organize the backend codebase into 5 projects under a new solution `backend/LeitnerPlatform.sln`:
- **`LeitnerPlatform.Core`** (Domain layer: Entities, Interfaces, Events, Exceptions)
- **`LeitnerPlatform.Data`** (Data layer: DbContext, Repository implementations, DbUp migrations, S3-compatible Backup Service)
- **`LeitnerPlatform.API`** (Presentation/API layer: Versioned Controllers, JWT setup, Rate Limiting, Self-Hosted CAPTCHA, Event Bus Runner)
- **`LeitnerPlatform.BackgroundWorker`** (Background runner hosting system jobs and listeners)
- **`LeitnerPlatform.Tests`** (xUnit unit & integration testing suite)

